/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"void-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!AMtVyoqrO5M9Ru2U.u6T8tsZkOcFjvrzG"},{"_id":"QACVidUBGQoHHpqW","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Mark Quarry","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A crawling hand can be assigned a quarry by anointing the hand with a drop of the intended quarry's blood. If the hand ever has no quarry, it automatically gains the next creature it damages as its quarry. The hand gains a +1 circumstance bonus to Perception checks when it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seeks} its quarry, to Survival checks when it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Tracks} its quarry, and damage rolls when it Strikes its quarry.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"mark-quarry","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["mark-quarry","action:seek"],"selector":"perception","type":"circumstance","value":1},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["mark-quarry","action:track"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":1},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["mark-quarry"],"selector":"strike-damage","type":"circumstance","value":1}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreV